class PostAnnotationBuilder(NXOpen.TransientObject): 
    """
        Builder to create NXOpen.CAE.PostAnnotation from NXOpen.CAE.Post

        User can pass entities which are same as current postview location. The entities have to be passed in following manner
    
        Elemental Result - Use NXOpen.CAE.PostAnnotationBuilder.SetElements only. 
        Nodal Result - Use NXOpen.CAE.PostAnnotationBuilder.SetNodes only. 
        Element-Nodal Result - Use NXOpen.CAE.PostAnnotationBuilder.SetElements and NXOpen.CAE.PostAnnotationBuilder.SetNodes. 
        Number of entities should be same for both.
        Element-Face Result - Use NXOpen.CAE.PostAnnotationBuilder.SetElements and NXOpen.CAE.PostAnnotationBuilder.SetEdgeFace. 
        Number of entities should be same for both.
        Element-Edge Result - Use NXOpen.CAE.PostAnnotationBuilder.SetElements and NXOpen.CAE.PostAnnotationBuilder.SetEdgeFace. 
        Number of entities should be same for both.
        Element-Face-Node Result - Use NXOpen.CAE.PostAnnotationBuilder.SetElements, NXOpen.CAE.PostAnnotationBuilder.SetNodes 
        and NXOpen.CAE.PostAnnotationBuilder.SetEdgeFace. Number of entities should be same for all three.
        Element-Edge-Node Result - Use NXOpen.CAE.PostAnnotationBuilder.SetElements, NXOpen.CAE.PostAnnotationBuilder.SetNodes 
        and NXOpen.CAE.PostAnnotationBuilder.SetEdgeFace. Number of entities should be same for all three.
    
        Though entities are being passed separately, they work as a set, so no of entities must be same for all.
    
    
    Cylic-Symmetric Result Number of Sectors should be same as Number of entities
    Axis-Symmetric Result Number of Angles should be same as number of entities.
    
